00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.427
Big time man, big time.

00:11:17.384 --> 00:11:20.825
Everyone's personality is
different so my leadership skills

00:11:20.825 --> 00:11:24.493
has different phases because
I understand what I'm

00:11:24.493 --> 00:11:25.826
